     * Idempotent: a second call while polling is already running is a no-op.
     * AC4 (E65S07): Guards on idleTimeoutFired — if the idle timeout has already fired,
     * polling must NOT restart automatically; the operator must tap the tap-to-refresh button.
     * AC2 (E65S07): Also guards on isPageHidden() — no polling while page is hidden.
     */
